<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
	<Fixlet>
		<Title>Lab - Low free space on system drive (&lt; 10 GB) - clean temp files</Title>
		<Description><![CDATA[<P>ลบไฟล์ temp เก่ากว่า 7 วัน, Windows Update download cache, เทถังขยะ แล้วล้าง component store</P><P>Success criteria = original relevance: ถ้าลบแล้วยังไม่ถึง 10 GB จะขึ้น <B>Failed</B> แปลว่าต้องมีคนตามดูต่อ</P>]]></Description>
		<Relevance><![CDATA[windows of operating system]]></Relevance>
		<Relevance><![CDATA[free space of drive of system folder < 10 * 1024 * 1024 * 1024]]></Relevance>
		<Category>Self Healing</Category>
		<Source>Internal</Source>
		<SourceID></SourceID>
		<SourceReleaseDate>2026-10-29</SourceReleaseDate>
		<SourceSeverity></SourceSeverity>
		<CVENames></CVENames>
		<SANSID></SANSID>
		<MIMEField>
			<Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
			<Value>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</Value>
		</MIMEField>
		<Domain>BESC</Domain>
		<DefaultAction ID="Action1">
			<Description>
				<PreLink>Click </PreLink>
				<Link>here</Link>
				<PostLink> to deploy this action.</PostLink>
			</Description>
			<ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell"><![CDATA[delete __createfile
createfile until __EOF__
$ErrorActionPreference = 'SilentlyContinue'
$log = 'C:\Windows\Temp\bigfix-disk-cleanup.log'
$before = (Get-PSDrive C).Free
$cutoff = (Get-Date).AddDays(-7)
$paths = @('C:\Windows\Temp\*', 'C:\Users\*\AppData\Local\Temp\*', 'C:\Windows\SoftwareDistribution\Download\*')
foreach ($p in $paths) {{
  Get-ChildItem $p -Recurse -Force | Where-Object {{ $_.LastWriteTime -lt $cutoff } | Remove-Item -Recurse -Force
}
Clear-RecycleBin -Force
Start-Process -Wait -WindowStyle Hidden dism.exe -ArgumentList '/Online','/Cleanup-Image','/StartComponentCleanup'
$after = (Get-PSDrive C).Free
"$(Get-Date -Format s) freed {{0:N1} GB" -f (($after - $before) / 1GB) | Out-File -Append $log
__EOF__

delete cleanup.ps1
move __createfile cleanup.ps1
action uses wow64 redirection false
waithidden "{pathname of native system folder}\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\powershell.exe" -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "{pathname of client folder of current site}\cleanup.ps1"
]]></ActionScript>
			<SuccessCriteria Option="OriginalRelevance"></SuccessCriteria>
		</DefaultAction>
	</Fixlet>
</BES>
